OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief constable recruitment
OL,4,Abrought forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police has brought
OL,7,Frecruitment for its chief constable
OL,8,Frole forward after a threat of legal
OL,9,Faction from a group representing senior
OL,10,Fofficers.
OL,12,FPolice and Crime Commissioner Alison
OL,13,FHernandez received a letter from the
OL,14,FChief Police Officers' Staff
OL,15,FAssociation outlining its intention to
OL,16,Fpursue legal action regarding her
OL,17,Fdecision to extend the contract of
OL,18,Finterim Chief Constable James Vaughan
OL,19,Fwithout running a recruitment process.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
